Budget presentation: neutral headings, meaningful qualifiers, semantic symbols, stable narratives and immutable source data verified for all profiles.
Budget completeness: 70 audited; 42 completed; 44 financial revisions; independent cent/percentage ledgers, immutable photographs and stale personal drafts verified.
Budget editorial: 70 complete copies reviewed; profiles, amounts and source provenance preserved; useful totals, distinct transfers, attributed/editorial questions and personal texts protected.
Budget profiles: 70 source ledgers and editorial outputs verified.
Budget portability: legacy migration, all drafts, three independent statuses, validated backup, both conflict choices, concurrency, corrupt-byte recovery, blocked storage, filters and exact summary totals passed.
DCA usage storage: full validation, observed-snapshot conflicts, refused access/quota, retries and legacy compatibility OK.
Radar read state: existing keys/scalar and grouped signals, unread identity, deduplication, 2000 limit, events, corrupt and unavailable storage verified.
